    VEXORA = V-90 strength + killcam-fixed mouse aim
    Same hard sticky lock feeling as V-90
    but uses mousemoverel so the real crosshair tracks the target
    → killcam / death view shows you actually aiming at them

    Still has optional humanize + hit chance so it’s not pure 10/10 detection
]]

